e":"Converting","viewer.convertAndUploadMedia.loading":"Loading","viewer.swipe.handle.ariaLabel":"Compare media by using the left and right arrow keys","viewer.swipe.map.placeholder.map1":"Map 1","viewer.swipe.map.placeholder.map2":"Map 2","viewer.tour.data.category.noTitle":"Untitled category","viewer.tour.skipTour":"Skip tour","component.storyLogo.default.altText":"Story logo","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.title":"Frame title","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.title.description":"Use this sample frame to preview your theme","component.themePreviewSample.text":"Text blocks","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.text.description":"Headings, like the one above, use the title font.\n\nParagraphs (and lists) use the paragraph font. Here is text formatted using \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color 1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor2\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color 2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor3\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color 3\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, and the theme’s \u003ca href=\"#link-style\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003elink style\u003c/a\u003e.\n\nSlides use the theme background color.","component.themePreviewSampleBriefing.text.description":"The slide title and headings, above, use the title and headings font. Paragraphs (and lists) use the paragraph font. Here is text formatted using \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color 1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor2\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color 2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor3\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color 3\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, and the theme’s \u003ca href=\"#link-style\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003elink style\u003c/a\u003e.","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.description":"This example frame includes content blocks like text, charts, buttons, and more.","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.buttons":"Buttons use the \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e and paragraph font with white or black text, or you can design your own custom style.","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.buttons.text":"Buttons","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.infographics":"Infographics","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.infographics.description":"Infographics use the \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e for the icon and number and the theme title font for the description.","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.infographic.number":"10","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.infographic.description":"Mountain peaks","component.themePreviewSampleFrame.maps.description":"Express maps and map tours use the \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e for symbols, theme fonts in pop-ups, and the theme basemap.","component.themePreviewSampleBriefing.expressMap.description":"Express maps use the \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eaccent color\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e for symbols, theme fonts in pop-ups, and the theme basemap.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.header":"You can edit this header style in Theme Colors","component.themePreviewSampleStory.cover.title":"Story title","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.cover.title":"Collection title","component.themePreviewSampleStory.cover.summary":"Use this sample story to preview your custom theme. As you modify colors, typography, and more, those changes will be reflected here.","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.cover.summary":"Use this sample collection to preview your theme","component.themePreviewSampleBriefing.cover.summary":"Use this sample briefing to preview your theme","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.bodyText1":"This is the collection description. It uses the paragraph font. Here is text formatted with \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003eaccent color 1\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor2\"\u003eaccent color 2,\u003c/span\u003e and \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor3\"\u003eaccent color 3\u003c/span\u003e, and the theme’s \u003ca href=\"#link-style\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003elink style\u003c/a\u003e.","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.item.title":"Item title","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.item.exampleTitle1":"Sample item 1","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.item.exampleTitle2":"Sample item 2","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.item.label1":"Redlands, California","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.item.label2":"Toronto, Canada","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.item.locationLabel":"If you set a location for an item, it can be shown in the collection overview map","component.themePreviewSampleStory.navigation.credits":"Credits","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText1":"This story includes several of the pieces you might use in your own story like paragraphs, buttons, separators, and more. To get started, expand a section of the styling panel and make some adjustments. As you make changes, you’ll see this story demonstrate how they look. For example, try changing the background color and observe how the story and the navigation bar (above) change.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText2":"Next, try changing the paragraph font, and see what happens to this text. Then, try adjusting the quote style and alignment to see how your choices affect the quote below. You’ll also notice that a quote uses the paragraph font for its text.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText3":"You can style your paragraph text to use \u003cstrong\u003ebold\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cem\u003eitalics\u003c/em\u003e, and \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ebold italics\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e, so you can emphasize important text accordingly. These come pre-packaged with the fonts you’ve chosen, so there’s nothing extra you need to configure.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText4":"If you add an express map or map tour to your story, the features will initially use the \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003eaccent color\u003c/span\u003e (but you can style them with a different accent color or any color you like).","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText5":"Data series are represented using theme accent colors and the paragraph font. Chart and axis titles use the title font.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText7":"Your theme’s secondary background color is used for content elements including table heading rows and the credits section (below). Tables use the paragraph color and font; the header row uses bold paragraph style.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText8":"You have a few different options for separator styles; toggle between them and see how the separator below changes. Your theme’s \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003eaccent color\u003c/span\u003e is used in separators, quotes, buttons, and links (unless you override it).","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText9":"Wondering what embed cards look like? Check out the one below!","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH2.basicBlocks":"Basic blocks","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH2.contentBlocks":"Media","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH2.dataVisualization":"Data visualization","component.themePreviewSampleStory.button.text":"This is a button","component.themePreviewSampleCollection.button.text":"Button style","component.themePreviewSampleStory.quote":"Quotes use the theme’s title font, but you can also choose one of several different styling options.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.chart.fieldText1":"Accent color 1","component.themePreviewSampleStory.chart.fieldText2":"Accent color 2","component.themePreviewSampleStory.chart.fieldText3":"Accent color 3","component.themePreviewSampleStory.chart.axisCategory":"Category axis","component.themePreviewSampleStory.chart.axisValue":"Value axis","component.themePreviewSampleStory.chart.title":"Chart title","component.themePreviewSampleStory.chart.categoryText1":"Category label","component.themePreviewSampleStory.quoteAttribution":"The quote source goes here","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH3.audio":"Audio","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH3.embed":"Embeds","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH3.expressmap":"Maps","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH3.chart":"Charts","component.themePreviewSampleStory.sectionHeadingH3.table":"Tables","component.themePreviewSampleStory.caption":"This is caption text, it inherits the font you’ve chosen for paragraph text. You can specify its color, too.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.embed.description":"Create inspiring, immersive stories by combining text, interactive maps, and other multimedia content. Publish and share your story with your organization or everyone around the world.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.bodyText10":"Below is an example of the audio player. The video player control bar and 360 image navigation bar use the same styles.","component.themePreviewSampleStory.text10":"This credits heading uses the title font","component.themePreviewSampleStory.text11":"This is the credits description; it uses the paragraph font. Here is what \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor1\"\u003eaccent color 1\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor2\"\u003eaccent color 2\u003c/span\u003e, and \u003cspan class=\"sm-text-color-themeColor3\"\u003eaccent color 3\u003c/span\u003e look like when used against the secondary background color.","c